course: dictionary
lesson: 15313
title: Slumber: sleep and stillness
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Slumber is an old-fashioned word for sleep, and you will meet it most in stories, poems and fairy tales. You can use the words around it as clues. «The baby lay in a deep slumber, her breathing soft and slow.» The words deep, soft and slow tell you she is fast asleep and peaceful.
explain: Slumber can also be a noun for a sleep, and a verb for the act of sleeping. «Her slumber was gentle.» is a noun, and «The old dog slumbered by the fire.» is a verb. Both are about sleep, but one names the sleep and the other describes someone sleeping.
explain: Slumber can also describe something that is quiet or not active for a long time. «The volcano had been in slumber for two hundred years.» The volcano is not asleep like a person. It is still and has not erupted, so it is dormant. The clue is the long time without any action.
fact: Slumber means sleep, often a peaceful or deep sleep.
fact: As a verb, slumber means to sleep, and slumbered is the past tense.
fact: «Slumber party» means a sleepover, where friends stay the night together (this use is common in the USA).
fact: A slumbering volcano is quiet and has not erupted for a long time.
exercise: «The old cat lay in a deep slumber by the fire.» What does slumber mean here? | Hunger | *Sleep | Singing | Running around
exercise: Mia says, «We are having a slumber party tonight.» What is a slumber party? | *A sleepover, where friends stay the night | A dinner for grown-ups | A sports match played at night | A quiet walk in the park
exercise: «The volcano had been in slumber for two hundred years.» Slumber here means the volcano is: | *Quiet and not erupting | Painting a picture | Pouring out lava | Singing loudly
test: «She slumbered peacefully under her warm quilt.» What does slumbered mean? | To dance | *To sleep, often peacefully | To eat quickly | To shout loudly
test: Which word in «Her slumber was gentle» is a noun? | her | was | gentle | *slumber
exam: «The storm woke the sleeping dragon from its long slumber.» What does long slumber mean? | A loud storm | *A long sleep | A short nap | A long walk
